  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Hello, I am the soul of a person who recently died in this mansion. Please
    help me escape this haunted mansion! I  have been stuck here for a long time,
    and only until a brave soul like you is able to make it out successfully can
    I also leave. I gift you with my flashlight that you can use to find the hidden
    keys to the area. However, this flashlight does not have any batteries, and you
    will have to solve some puzzles in order to gain them. You can keep track of
    all the items you have collected and need to collect in the journal provided
    to you. You will need to collect 3 keys in order to exit, and you will need 3
    batteries for the flashlight to work and collect the keys. However, the snail
    ghost can use up one battery if you come in direct contact with it, so you need
    to stay careful. I wish you luck on your journey.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
